{"availability":"available","full":"naamjapacounter/naamjapacounter.github.io","name":"naamjapacounter.github.io","description":"A naam japa counter is more than just a simple tally tool. It is a spiritual bridge that helps practitioners maintain the discipline of \"Japa\" — the meditative repetition of a mantra or a divine name.","category":"Design","language":"HTML","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-02-26T12:57:41Z","updated":"2026-02-28T07:23:36Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://naamjapacounter.github.io/","topics":["css3","devotional","frontend-practice","frontend-projects","html5","javascript","mediatation","metadata","naam-jaap","responsive","responsive-design","seo-optimization","vanilla-javascript","webapp"],"demo":"https://naamjapacounter.github.io/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T13:57:46.191Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T13:57:46.191Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T13:57:46.191Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T13:57:46.191Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Welcome to the definitive home for your spiritual journey. If you are looking for a reliable, beautiful, and easy-to-use naam japa counter, you have arrived at the right place. Our mission is to provide devotees with a sacred digital space to track their radha naam jap, mantra counts, and daily spiritual progress without distractions.","In today's fast-paced digital world, maintaining a consistent spiritual practice can be challenging. Whether you are a seasoned practitioner or just starting your journey with radha naam jap, having a dedicated digital japa counter can make a significant difference. Our app is designed to be your constant companion, helping you stay connected to the divine with every tap.","A naam japa counter is more than just a simple tally tool. It is a spiritual bridge that helps practitioners maintain the discipline of \"Japa\" — the meditative repetition of a mantra or a divine name. Traditionally, this is done using a physical Mala (prayer beads), usually consisting of 108 beads. However, in modern life, carrying a physical Mala everywhere isn't always practical."],"features":["No Login Required: You don't need to give us your email or phone number.","No Cloud Sync: Your jaap counter data never leaves your phone.","Permanent Local Storage: We use a secure Room database to ensure your history is safe through app restarts, but it only lives where you live — on your phone.","Portability: You always have your phone with you. Whether you are commuting, in a waiting room, or traveling, your naam jaap counter is ready.","Accurate Logging: It is easy to forget how many malas you did yesterday. With our history logs, you have a perfect record of your journey."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/naamjapacounter/naamjapacounter.github.io/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b9fff3dba309e06b9ce4849285668acd63006ccdafcb80ab0798ead88df72438","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T13:57:46.418Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T13:57:46.418Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Welcome to the definitive home for your spiritual journey. If you are looking for a reliable, beautiful, and easy-to-use naam japa counter, you have arrived at the right place. Our mission is to provide devotees with a sacred digital space to track their radha naam jap, mantra counts, and daily spiritual progress without distractions.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/naamjapacounter/naamjapacounter.github.io/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Most naam jaap counter online applications require you to create an account, which means your personal meditation data is stored on a cloud server somewhere.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/naamjapacounter/naamjapacounter.github.io/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"No Login Required: You don't need to give us your email or phone number.","sourceUr